        "solution": "Follow the STAR-case checks before replacing the radio: forget the vehicle in iPhone CarPlay settings, delete and re-pair the phone in the radio and Bluetooth settings, restart the phone, inspect and clean the phone and vehicle USB ports, inspect the cable connections, and test with an official Apple MFi-certified Lightning cable.",
